{
 "font_size": 0.4,
 "font_color": "#FFFFFF",
 "background_alpha": 0.5,
 "background_color": "#9C27B0",
 "Stroke": "none",
 "type": "AIsubtitle",
 "lang": "zh",
 "version": "eng-1.2.0-Index-johns-pen-lite",
 "body": [
  {
   "content": "我们将讲解运球角度",
   "from": 6.64,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 1,
   "to": 8.32
  },
  {
   "content": "想象一下世界上最好的球员",
   "from": 8.32,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 2,
   "to": 10.16
  },
  {
   "content": "像杰森·塔滕斯",
   "from": 10.16,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 3,
   "to": 11.06
  },
  {
   "content": "像萨斯",
   "from": 11.06,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 4,
   "to": 12.08
  },
  {
   "content": "像贾伦·布伦森",
   "from": 12.08,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 5,
   "to": 13.18
  },
  {
   "content": "他们在切入防守者时如此 elite",
   "from": 13.18,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 6,
   "to": 16.78
  },
  {
   "content": "我知道很多球员在摆脱防守时会遇到困难",
   "from": 16.78,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 7,
   "to": 19.42
  },
  {
   "content": "被封盖",
   "from": 19.42,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 8,
   "to": 20.1
  },
  {
   "content": "被推离防守位置",
   "from": 20.1,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 9,
   "to": 21.36
  },
  {
   "content": "整个系列内容将非常有帮助",
   "from": 21.36,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 10,
   "to": 23.82
  },
  {
   "content": "我们将详细讲解的关键点之一是保持手臂向前",
   "from": 23.82,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 11,
   "to": 27.52
  },
  {
   "content": "第二点",
   "from": 27.52,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 12,
   "to": 28.32
  },
  {
   "content": "如何在防守者接近前切入",
   "from": 28.32,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 13,
   "to": 31.09
  },
  {
   "content": "第三点是如何利用并调整髋部",
   "from": 31.09,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 14,
   "to": 34.57
  },
  {
   "content": "冲向篮筐",
   "from": 34.57,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 15,
   "to": 35.29
  },
  {
   "content": "这样就不会被防守者绕过",
   "from": 35.29,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 16,
   "to": 37.71
  },
  {
   "content": "我们直接切入防守者并攻击篮下",
   "from": 37.71,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 17,
   "to": 41.45
  },
  {
   "content": "首要关键点是当你突破时",
   "from": 44.12,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 18,
   "to": 46
  },
  {
   "content": "始终要保持手臂向前",
   "from": 46,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 19,
   "to": 48.06
  },
  {
   "content": "因为如果我运球手臂会向后",
   "from": 48.06,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 20,
   "to": 50.08
  },
  {
   "content": "他就能拿到球",
   "from": 50.08,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 21,
   "to": 51.2
  },
  {
   "content": "也能碰到我的身体完成封盖",
   "from": 51.2,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 22,
   "to": 53.92
  },
  {
   "content": "如果我运球时手臂在前方",
   "from": 53.92,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 23,
   "to": 56.16
  },
  {
   "content": "试着让教练看到",
   "from": 56.16,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 24,
   "to": 57.43
  },
  {
   "content": "现在他怎么拿到球",
   "from": 57.43,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 25,
   "to": 58.53
  },
  {
   "content": "我有了保护并说明这种情况",
   "from": 58.53,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 26,
   "to": 60.95
  },
  {
   "content": "这种情况在比赛中经常发生",
   "from": 60.95,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 27,
   "to": 62.769
  },
  {
   "content": "我可能保持手臂向前",
   "from": 62.769,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 28,
   "to": 64.289
  },
  {
   "content": "但他可能伸手去抢球",
   "from": 64.289,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 29,
   "to": 66.149
  },
  {
   "content": "嗯",
   "from": 66.149,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 30,
   "to": 66.369
  },
  {
   "content": "在这种情况下",
   "from": 66.369,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 31,
   "to": 66.969
  },
  {
   "content": "我可以开始拨球",
   "from": 66.969,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 32,
   "to": 67.929
  },
  {
   "content": "可以用肘部",
   "from": 67.929,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 33,
   "to": 68.729
  },
  {
   "content": "可以挥臂击打",
   "from": 68.729,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 34,
   "to": 70.5
  },
  {
   "content": "但最重要的是避免手臂向前",
   "from": 70.5,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 35,
   "to": 74.06
  },
  {
   "content": "然后挥动",
   "from": 74.06,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 36,
   "to": 75.44
  },
  {
   "content": "然后手臂又向后",
   "from": 75.44,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 37,
   "to": 76.84
  },
  {
   "content": "这样他又有了优势",
   "from": 76.84,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 38,
   "to": 79.61
  },
  {
   "content": "手臂必须始终向前",
   "from": 79.61,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 39,
   "to": 81.37
  },
  {
   "content": "但我们要保持",
   "from": 81.37,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 40,
   "to": 82.73
  },
  {
   "content": "你可以这样运球",
   "from": 82.73,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 41,
   "to": 84.07
  },
  {
   "content": "如果试图向前而他的手臂在上",
   "from": 84.07,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 42,
   "to": 86.27
  },
  {
   "content": "也可以向上拨球摆脱",
   "from": 86.27,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 43,
   "to": 88.77
  },
  {
   "content": "但首先要理解",
   "from": 88.77,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 44,
   "to": 91.11
  },
  {
   "content": "当你起动时",
   "from": 91.11,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 45,
   "to": 92.31
  },
  {
   "content": "手臂绝不能向后",
   "from": 92.31,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 46,
   "to": 94.37
  },
  {
   "content": "手臂必须向前",
   "from": 94.37,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 47,
   "to": 96.45
  },
  {
   "content": "如果我这样起动",
   "from": 96.45,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 48,
   "to": 98.11
  },
  {
   "content": "现在手臂向前向前向前",
   "from": 98.11,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 49,
   "to": 99.85
  },
  {
   "content": "我可以变向",
   "from": 99.85,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 50,
   "to": 100.29
  },
  {
   "content": "我可以推进",
   "from": 100.29,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 51,
   "to": 101.039
  },
  {
   "content": "我能做到我想做的，另一个好处是换个角度想想",
   "from": 101.039,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 52,
   "to": 105.19
  },
  {
   "content": "所以说我开车推臂会回到这里",
   "from": 105.19,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 53,
   "to": 107.41
  },
  {
   "content": "如果我向后推我的手臂",
   "from": 107.41,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 54,
   "to": 109.33
  },
  {
   "content": "然后我试图撞击",
   "from": 109.33,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 55,
   "to": 110.78
  },
  {
   "content": "我其实撞不到他们",
   "from": 110.78,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 56,
   "to": 112.02
  },
  {
   "content": "所以如果我想",
   "from": 112.02,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 57,
   "to": 112.88
  },
  {
   "content": "做一个后撤步停球",
   "from": 112.88,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 58,
   "to": 114.72
  },
  {
   "content": "我没有支点",
   "from": 114.72,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 59,
   "to": 116.02
  },
  {
   "content": "保持手臂前伸的关键是帮助肩膀越过他的肩膀",
   "from": 116.02,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 60,
   "to": 121.05
  },
  {
   "content": "如果我能用前臂推进",
   "from": 121.05,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 61,
   "to": 123.19
  },
  {
   "content": "并且能让肩膀越过他的",
   "from": 123.19,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 62,
   "to": 125.39
  },
  {
   "content": "现在你有了撞击空间完成动作",
   "from": 125.39,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 63,
   "to": 127.53
  },
  {
   "content": "你也可以到这里撞击并拉开距离",
   "from": 127.53,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 64,
   "to": 130.579
  },
  {
   "content": "前伸手臂是形成良好角度推进的第一步",
   "from": 130.579,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 65,
   "to": 137.88
  },
  {
   "content": "现在我们的手臂已经前伸",
   "from": 145.78,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 66,
   "to": 147.38
  },
  {
   "content": "如果我们只是保持前伸",
   "from": 147.38,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 67,
   "to": 148.72
  },
  {
   "content": "但看看我们拥有的空间",
   "from": 148.72,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 68,
   "to": 150.56
  },
  {
   "content": "你仍然可以挤进我",
   "from": 150.56,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 69,
   "to": 152.22
  },
  {
   "content": "现在我仍然远离篮筐",
   "from": 152.22,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 70,
   "to": 154.38
  },
  {
   "content": "一旦手臂在前方",
   "from": 154.38,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 71,
   "to": 156.2
  },
  {
   "content": "下一步是收肘",
   "from": 156.2,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 72,
   "to": 158.13
  },
  {
   "content": "如果我这样推进",
   "from": 158.13,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 73,
   "to": 159.21
  },
  {
   "content": "我要慢动作演示",
   "from": 159.21,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 74,
   "to": 160.23
  },
  {
   "content": "手臂前伸然后收肘",
   "from": 160.23,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 75,
   "to": 162.45
  },
  {
   "content": "现在我可以转向",
   "from": 162.45,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 76,
   "to": 163.99
  },
  {
   "content": "发起接触并缩小空间",
   "from": 163.99,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 77,
   "to": 167.01
  },
  {
   "content": "推进的关键能力之一就是贴近防守者",
   "from": 167.01,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 78,
   "to": 171.33
  },
  {
   "content": "在防守者贴近你之前",
   "from": 171.33,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 79,
   "to": 173.54
  },
  {
   "content": "如果我这样推进",
   "from": 173.54,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 80,
   "to": 174.54
  },
  {
   "content": "然后我直接到这里",
   "from": 174.54,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 81,
   "to": 175.56
  },
  {
   "content": "但只是外扩",
   "from": 175.56,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 82,
   "to": 177.36
  },
  {
   "content": "他仍然可以贴近我",
   "from": 177.36,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 83,
   "to": 178.86
  },
  {
   "content": "我们必须前伸手臂",
   "from": 178.86,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 84,
   "to": 180.28
  },
  {
   "content": "并迅速用肘部贴近防守者注意",
   "from": 180.28,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 85,
   "to": 183.26
  },
  {
   "content": "现在肘部和肩膀之间没有空间",
   "from": 183.26,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 86,
   "to": 186.39
  },
  {
   "content": "现在我可以操控",
   "from": 186.39,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 87,
   "to": 187.47
  },
  {
   "content": "我可以摆脱",
   "from": 187.47,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 88,
   "to": 188.15
  },
  {
   "content": "我可以上篮",
   "from": 188.15,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 89,
   "to": 189.33
  },
  {
   "content": "但我们必须前伸手臂",
   "from": 189.33,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 90,
   "to": 191.59
  },
  {
   "content": "在某个时刻无论是这里",
   "from": 191.59,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 91,
   "to": 195.05
  },
  {
   "content": "然后我可以回到这里",
   "from": 195.05,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 92,
   "to": 196.63
  },
  {
   "content": "但肘部贴近身体且肩膀保持前方的瞬间",
   "from": 196.63,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 93,
   "to": 200.29
  },
  {
   "content": "现在你对防守者有巨大优势",
   "from": 200.29,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 94,
   "to": 204.94
  },
  {
   "content": "第三个关键点是髋部前倾",
   "from": 211.66,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 95,
   "to": 214.34
  },
  {
   "content": "如果我推臂在前方",
   "from": 214.34,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 96,
   "to": 216.1
  },
  {
   "content": "肘部收紧",
   "from": 216.1,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 97,
   "to": 216.96
  },
  {
   "content": "但以这个角度推进",
   "from": 216.96,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 98,
   "to": 218.5
  },
  {
   "content": "我的髋部朝向这边",
   "from": 218.5,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 99,
   "to": 220.149
  },
  {
   "content": "所以如果对手开始推我",
   "from": 220.149,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 100,
   "to": 221.889
  },
  {
   "content": "我要跟着我的胯部移动",
   "from": 221.889,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 101,
   "to": 223.71
  },
  {
   "content": "所以如果我们想冲到篮筐前沿",
   "from": 223.71,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 102,
   "to": 225.43
  },
  {
   "content": "必须让胯部对准篮筐前方",
   "from": 225.43,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 103,
   "to": 227.79
  },
  {
   "content": "这里有一个帮助很多球员的小技巧是",
   "from": 227.79,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 104,
   "to": 231.31
  },
  {
   "content": "如果我在防守者的右侧",
   "from": 231.31,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 105,
   "to": 233.49
  },
  {
   "content": "我几乎要感觉胯部向左侧展开",
   "from": 233.49,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 106,
   "to": 237.85
  },
  {
   "content": "很多时候你以为自己在这样做",
   "from": 237.85,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 107,
   "to": 240.77
  },
  {
   "content": "其实这才是正确的方式",
   "from": 240.77,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 108,
   "to": 243.6
  },
  {
   "content": "当我慢动作起跳时",
   "from": 243.6,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 109,
   "to": 245.3
  },
  {
   "content": "我要让胯部对准篮筐",
   "from": 245.3,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 110,
   "to": 247.26
  },
  {
   "content": "但几乎会感觉我转向这边",
   "from": 247.26,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 111,
   "to": 249.9
  },
  {
   "content": "但仔细观察并暂停画面",
   "from": 249.9,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 112,
   "to": 252.39
  },
  {
   "content": "我的胯部其实正对篮筐",
   "from": 252.39,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 113,
   "to": 254.17
  },
  {
   "content": "我们绝不能让球在右侧",
   "from": 254.17,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 114,
